research/audit/wave7-refuter-tasks/cor-separated-uniformizable-iff-tychonoff.md-43-[L2] A separated compatible uniformity induces a Hausdorff topology ([[thm-separated-uniformity-iff-induced-topology-is-hausdorff]]).
