research/audit/wave7-refuter-tasks/cor-separated-uniformizable-iff-tychonoff.md-49-[L5] Every Hausdorff space is $T_1$ ([[lem-urysohn-sits-between-hausdorff-and-regular-plus-t1]], clause 2).
